{"id":"711da376393d5bc5","group":"20","path":"20/20-thm-play-functionals-as-sets.md","title":"枚举博弈可以编码函数与泛函","display":"thm-play-functionals-as-sets — 枚举博弈可以编码函数与泛函","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-thm-play-functionals-as-sets","aliases":["20-thm-play-functionals-as-sets"],"display":"thm-play-functionals-as-sets — 枚举博弈可以编码函数与泛函","chapter":"16","section":"16.2","source_kind":"book","verification_status":"proved-in-note","source_reference":"§16.2.1；Theorem 2.1.9；Theorem 3.3.8","source_pdf_pages":[61,92,250],"source_printed_pages":[25,56,222],"depends_on":["[[20-df-lachlan-game]]","[[20-df-functional-graph]]","[[20-thm-graph]]","[[20-df-re]]","[[20-df-consistent-oracle-axioms]]","[[20-df-tred]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-thm-play-functionals-as-sets"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-thm-play-functionals-as-sets</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-play-functionals-as-sets — 枚举博弈可以编码函数与泛函"},{"key":"chapter","html":"16"},{"key":"section","html":"16.2"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"§16.2.1；Theorem 2.1.9；Theorem 3.3.8"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>61</span><span>92</span><span>250</span></div>"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>25</span><span>56</span><span>222</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"2772d51949360c14\" href=\"?note=2772d51949360c14\" title=\"20-df-lachlan-game\">20-df-lachlan-game</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"634b02102672cc2a\" href=\"?note=634b02102672cc2a\" title=\"20-df-functional-graph\">20-df-functional-graph</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"15f8b03faeebed96\" href=\"?note=15f8b03faeebed96\" title=\"20-thm-graph\">20-thm-graph</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"60af447f5d59a8dc\" href=\"?note=60af447f5d59a8dc\" title=\"20-df-re\">20-df-re</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"c803835be7de786d\" href=\"?note=c803835be7de786d\" title=\"20-df-consistent-oracle-axioms\">20-df-consistent-oracle-axioms</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"52376918bee1945e\" href=\"?note=52376918bee1945e\" title=\"20-df-tred\">20-df-tred</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f:\\omega\\rightharpoonup\\omega\">\\(f:\\omega\\rightharpoonup\\omega\\)</span> 是部分函数；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e\\in\\omega\">\\(e\\in\\omega\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G_e=\\{(\\sigma,x,y):\\Phi_e^\\sigma(x)\\downarrow=y\\}\">\\(G_e=\\{(\\sigma,x,y):\\Phi_e^\\sigma(x)\\downarrow=y\\}\\)</span> 按固定三元组代码解释。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"2772d51949360c14\" href=\"?note=2772d51949360c14\" title=\"20-df-lachlan-game\">20-df-lachlan-game</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"634b02102672cc2a\" href=\"?note=634b02102672cc2a\" title=\"20-df-functional-graph\">20-df-functional-graph</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"15f8b03faeebed96\" href=\"?note=15f8b03faeebed96\" title=\"20-thm-graph\">20-thm-graph</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"60af447f5d59a8dc\" href=\"?note=60af447f5d59a8dc\" title=\"20-df-re\">20-df-re</a>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"c803835be7de786d\" href=\"?note=c803835be7de786d\" title=\"20-df-consistent-oracle-axioms\">20-df-consistent-oracle-axioms</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"52376918bee1945e\" href=\"?note=52376918bee1945e\" title=\"20-df-tred\">20-df-tred</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}play\\text{-}functionals\\text{-}as\\text{-}sets}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\nf\\in\\mathcal C_1\\Longleftrightarrow\\operatorname{graph}(f)\\in\\mathcal E,\\\\\n\\forall e\\ [\\operatorname{code}[G_e]\\in\\mathcal E].\n\\end{gathered}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}play\\text{-}functionals\\text{-}as\\text{-}sets}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\nf\\in\\mathcal C_1\\Longleftrightarrow\\operatorname{graph}(f)\\in\\mathcal E,\\\\\n\\forall e\\ [\\operatorname{code}[G_e]\\in\\mathcal E].\n\\end{gathered}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\">\\(f\\)</span> 部分可计算，同时模拟各输入的程序，停止时枚举唯一输出的有序对；故图 c.e.。若部分函数图 c.e.，在输入 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span> 搜索出现的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(x,y)\">\\((x,y)\\)</span>，单值性保证所得输出正确；无见证时发散，给部分可计算函数。</p>\n<p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G_e\">\\(G_e\\)</span>，同时模拟所有有限串 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\">\\(\\sigma\\)</span> 和输入 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span>，只接纳查询未超出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\">\\(\\sigma\\)</span> 的停止输出；有界停止关系有效，故三元组图 c.e.。兼容 oracle 的输出一致来自机器确定性，延伸单调性来自已停止计算只查询有限前缀。作为游戏走法，可逐步枚举这些图的元素。反向随意枚举三元组不自动满足一致性；合法泛函图的转换仍需一致性和延伸条件。本条没有把非法公理枚举升级为 Turing 泛函。</p>\n<p>来源：§16.2.1；印刷 25, 56, 222 / PDF 61, 92, 250。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-lachlan-game","status":"resolved","id":"2772d51949360c14","anchor":"ref-1","ta